            <title><![CDATA[CompTIA Security+ Certification]]></title>
            <link>https://dudukling.github.io/my-blog/blog/comptia-security-plus-certification</link>
            <guid>https://dudukling.github.io/my-blog/blog/comptia-security-plus-certification</guid>
            <pubDate>Mon, 09 Jun 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[About]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="about">About<a href="https://dudukling.github.io/my-blog/blog/comptia-security-plus-certification#about" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to About" title="Direct link to About">​</a></h2>
<p>Certification <code>CompTIA Security+ Certification</code>, also known as <code>SY0-701</code>.</p>
<p>The definition of certification is as follow:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>CompTIA Security+ is the premier global certification that establishes the essential skills required for core security functions and a career in IT security.</p>
<p>It showcases professionals' capabilities in securing networks, applications, and devices, ensuring data integrity, confidentiality, and availability.</p>
<p>CompTIA Security+ focuses on practical, hands-on skills to tackle real-world challenges.</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="tips">Tips<a href="https://dudukling.github.io/my-blog/blog/comptia-security-plus-certification#tips" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Tips" title="Direct link to Tips">​</a></h2>
<p>Some materials used in the study for the certification:</p>
<ul>
<li>Course: <a href="https://www.udemy.com/course/securityplus" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Udemy - CompTIA Security+ (SY0-701) Complete Course</a>.</li>
<li>Simulations: <a href="https://www.udemy.com/course/comptia-security-sy0-701-practice-exams" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Udemy - CompTIA Security+ (SY0-701) Practice Exams Set 1</a>.</li>
<li>Also created some <a href="https://apps.ankiweb.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Anki</a> Cards to help remembering all the names an acronyms.</li>
</ul>
<p>See my certification badge <a href="https://www.credly.com/badges/4a19dd33-9263-47b1-8682-678cae0f119f/public_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">here</a>.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="mind-map">Mind Map<a href="https://dudukling.github.io/my-blog/blog/comptia-security-plus-certification#mind-map" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Mind Map" title="Direct link to Mind Map">​</a></h2>
<p>Just a part of the "Mind Map" I created on my journey to get the certification.</p>
<p>General Security Concepts</p>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Mind Map - General Security Concepts 1" src="https://dudukling.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/sec-1-25ed0f05c4bee7e167393936b80243a2.png" width="5537" height="3690" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>Threats, Vulnerabilities and mitigations</p>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Mind Map - Threats, Vulnerabilities and mitigations 1" src="https://dudukling.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/sec-2-e000fbea6609436cf03bf1ea9294b32e.png" width="5479" height="5262" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>Security Architecture</p>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Mind Map - Security Architecture 1" src="https://dudukling.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/sec-3-69eb716887bd6b3678d2ce23971792d4.png" width="5663" height="4840" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>Security Operations</p>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Mind Map - Security Operations 1" src="https://dudukling.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/sec-4-825812aee04f1c74994dca468ddcf79e.png" width="6567" height="3232" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<p>Security Program Management and oversight</p>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Mind Map - Security Program Management and oversight 1" src="https://dudukling.github.io/my-blog/assets/images/sec-5-5f9bc178e1b1a4e9ebf3f540517e2b49.png" width="5551" height="2747" class="img_ev3q"></p>]]></content:encoded>
