            <description><![CDATA[About]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="about">About<a href="https://dudukling.github.io/my-blog/blog/psm-certification#about" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to About" title="Direct link to About">​</a></h2>
<p>Certification <code>Professional Scrum Master™ I</code>, also known as <code>PSM I</code>.</p>
<p>The definition of certification is as follow:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>The Professional Scrum Master™ I (PSM I) certification validates your knowledge of the Scrum framework, the Scrum Master accountabilities and how to apply Scrum.</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="tips">Tips<a href="https://dudukling.github.io/my-blog/blog/psm-certification#tips" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Tips" title="Direct link to Tips">​</a></h2>
<p>Some materials used in the study for the certification:</p>
<ul>
<li>Primary resource: <code>Scrum Guide</code>.</li>
<li>Primary Course: <a href="https://www.udemy.com/course/formacao-total-em-scrum" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Udemy - Formação total em Scrum</a> (pt-br).</li>
<li>Other Course: <a href="https://www.alura.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Alura</a>'s Scrum courses in Agile training (pt-br).</li>
<li>Simulations: <a href="https://www.udemy.com/course/simulados-para-certificacoes-scrum-master" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Udemy - Simulados para certificações Scrum Master</a> (pt-br).</li>
<li>Other resources: Read a good part of the articles on the certification website as study recommendations, the "Scrum Master Learning Path".</li>
</ul>
<p>See my certification badge <a href="https://www.credly.com/badges/572249e3-f991-4198-948d-3c3d61b06c8c/public_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">here</a>.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="mind-map">Mind Map<a href="https://dudukling.github.io/my-blog/blog/psm-certification#mind-map" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Mind Map" title="Direct link to Mind Map">​</a></h2>
