<li>Simulations: There are some books on the internet with lots of questions to practice.</li>
<li>Also created some <a href="https://apps.ankiweb.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Anki</a> Cards to help remembering all the names an acronyms.</li>
